flowchart TB
  User[Flutter and Browser] --> CF[Cloudflare WAF and TLS]
  CF --> NGINX[Dedicated Nginx VM - outside Swarm]
  NGINX --> VPN[Private route or WireGuard - upstream TLS]
  VPN --> GATE[Private Swarm Gateway]
  subgraph SWARM[Docker Swarm - 3 Managers plus 2 or more Workers HA option]
    GATE --> WEB[Django Web]
    GATE --> ID[Identity Service]
    GATE --> CT[Content Service]
    GATE --> EN[Engagement Service]
    EN --> PT[Points Service - internal only]
    GATE --> MO[Moderation Service]
    CT --> W[Celery Workers]
  end
  ID --> DB[(Private PostgreSQL - logical service DBs)]
  CT --> DB
  EN --> DB
  PT --> DB
  W --> REDIS[(Private Redis)]
  CT --> VID[Managed Video Provider]
  SWARM --> OBS[Central Monitoring and Audit]
  DB --> BK[Encrypted Offsite Backups]